s=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Hocus Pocus in Concert</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 03 Jul 2026 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/hocus-pocus-film-with-live-orchestra-eventim-apollo-21847219/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/hocus-pocus-film-with-live-orchestra-eventim-apollo-21847219/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/lounge-pass-upgrade-eventim-apollo-21820484/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"HP Eventim 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>This Autumn, Disney’s<em> <strong>Hocus Pocus</strong> </em>is to be presented live in concert with the films score performed by an orchestra live to film. The matinee performance, starting at 14:30, is to take place at London’s Eventim Apollo on Sunday 25<sup>th</sup> October, the perfect Halloween treat. </p>\n<p>The score for the legendary Halloween comedy film was created by Emmy Award®-winning and GRAMMY®-nominated composer John Debney. </p>\n<p>Accidentally conjured on Halloween night in modern-day Salem, three seventeenth-century witches known as the Sanderson sisters, plot to steal the life essence from the town’s children to ensure their own eternal life. The diabolical sisters are comically outwitted by three prankster kids and aided by Thackery Binx, a boy transformed into a cat centuries earlier for interfering with the witches. Released on July 16, 1993, and directed by Kenny Ortega, the spooky comedy stars Bette Midler (Winifred), Sarah Jessica Parker (Sarah), Kathy Najimy (Mary), Omri Katz (Max), Thora Birch (Dani), and Vinessa Shaw (Allison).<strong><br /></strong></p>\n<p><strong>AGE RESTRICTION: 14’s and under to be accompanied by an adult. </strong></p>\n<p><strong>FILM CERTIFICATE: PG</strong></p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/HP_Eventim_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"HP Eventim 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Hocus Pocus in Concert - 25th October 2026 at Eventim Apollo</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table