Sunday 25th October 2026</p>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Jim Henson&#039;s Labyrinth: In Concert</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-06-12T10:00:00+01:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 12 Jun 2026 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-06-12T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/jim-hensons-labyrinth-in-concert-eventim-apollo-21759111/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2026-06-12T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/jim-hensons-labyrinth-in-concert-eventim-apollo-21759111/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"#information-section\" target=\"_self\">More information</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"LAB Social 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>Following an extensive UK tour in 2025 and Spring 2026, including a sold-out date at London’s Royal Festival Hall, <strong>Jim Henson’s Labyrinth: In Concert </strong>is returning to the capital for an exclusive one off show this Halloween at London’s Eventim Apollo on Sunday 25th October.</p>\n<p>Taking place just before Halloween, audiences will be transported back to the Goblin City as Jim Henson’s 1986 cult classic is projected on a massive HD cinema screen. A powerhouse live band will perform in perfect synchronization with David Bowie’s original, isolated vocals—bringing the iconic soundtrack and Trevor Jones' enchanting score to life in an electrifying fusion of film and live music.</p>\n<p>Labyrinth’s fiercely loyal cult following has grown for forty years since the films theatrical release on June 27th, 1986. Starring David Bowie and Jennifer Connelly, alongside a spectacular cast of goblins and creatures from the world-renowned Jim Henson’s Creature Shop, the film remains a pinnacle of fantasy cinema.</p>\n<p>The live concert experience celebrates the brilliant musical collaboration between Bowie and Trevor Jones, spotlighting timeless Bowie hits performed live, including Magic Dance, Underground, and As the World Falls Down.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/LAB_Social_1080x1080.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"LAB Social 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Jim Henson&#039;s Labyrinth: In Concert - 25th October 2026 at Eventim Apollo</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors \">Doors</div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>October 25th 2026</div>\n                <div>Evening</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">18:30</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n              \n                      </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n              <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"py-md\">\n  <h2 class=\"variable-color\">Get pre-sale access by signing up to our newsletter</h2>\n    <div class=\"event-signup-content__form-wrapper mt-md\">\n    <div id=\"prepform\" class=\"accord-form\"></div>\n    <script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={2C975A98-C100-0F41-E92D-5A0BB8CB9FBB}\"></script>\n  </div>\n  </div>  </div>      \n      \n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"newsletter-modal fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full outline-none z-50\" id=\"newsletterModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__click-break\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__inner bg-white modal-dialog relative w-auto\">\n\n\t\t\n    <div class=\"newsletter-modal__close\">\n      <button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"54\" height=\"54\" viewBox=\"0 0 54 54\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect x=\"12.7285\" y=\"39.5977\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-45 12.7285 39.5977)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n<rect x=\"39.5977\" y=\"41.0117\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-135 39.5977 41.0117)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n</svg>\n\t\t