 <h1 class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">The Holiday in Concert</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-03-27T10:00:00+00:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 27 Mar 2026 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-03-27T10:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/artist/the-holiday-in-concert/the-holiday-in-concert-3418546/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2026-03-27T10:00:00+00:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/artist/the-holiday-in-concert/the-holiday-in-concert-3418546/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/search/?affiliate=HAL&searchterm=The+Holiday+in+concert\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"TH Eventim 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>Cherished Christmas romcom <strong>The Holiday</strong> (2006) will be presented live in concert this festive season at Eventim Apollo.</p>\n<p>The show will see the films enchanting score performed by a complete concert orchestra in perfect harmony with the full running of the film, on an HD cinema size screen. </p>\n<p>The tour, becoming a firm favourite for families as well as music and movie lovers each festive period, follows on from a sell-out run of dates last Christmas. The in-concert experience with a full orchestra and cinema size screen is an incredibly unique and immersive way to experience The Holiday.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/TH_Eventim_1080x1080_2026-03-20-115702_tgkb.jpg?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"TH Eventim 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">The Holiday in Concert</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n          