ble-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-06-11T10:00:00+01:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 11 Jun 2026 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-06-11T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/twilight-new-moon-eventim-apollo-21633663/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2026-06-11T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/twilight-new-moon-eventim-apollo-21633663/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/lounge-pass-upgrade-eventim-apollo-21663509/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"Twilight NM27 LDN Square 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>Return to The Twilight Saga with <strong>The Twilight Saga: New Moon in Concert</strong>, a cinematic live- to-film experience from Lionsgate, and the creators of Twilight in Concert. The second chapter of the beloved saga comes to life as a 12-piece ensemble of rock and orchestral musicians performs the film’s powerful score live alongside the movie</p>\n<p>As The Twilight Saga: New Moon unfolds on the big screen, Bella Swan faces her most melancholic chapter yet. When Edward Cullen disappears from her life without a trace, Bella is left in a world that suddenly feels empty and unfamiliar. In the heartbreak and darkness, she finds comfort in her childhood friend Jacob Black, a member of the mysterious native tribe. Their bond grows deeper with every passing moment, until it begins to pull her toward ancient legends and unseen forces she never imagined. </p>\n<p>A story of love, loss, and the pull of two worlds, The Twilight Saga: New Moon in Concert brings one of The Twilight Saga’s most emotional chapters to life through music and film. </p>\n<p>Secure your tickets and continue the journey.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/Twilight-NM27_LDN-Square_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"Twilight NM27 LDN Square 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Twilight: New Moon in Concert - 7th February 2027 at Eventim Apollo</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                