span-12 md:col-span-7\">\n                          <p class=\"date variable-color\">Thursday 11th February 2027</p>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"h2 variable-color event-hero__title\">Marvel Studios&#039; Infinity Saga Concert Experience</h1>\n        \n\n                                                                <p class=\"variable-color\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">TICKETS ON SALE: 03 Jul 2026 AT 10:00am</p>\n                  \n                <div class=\"mt-sm\">\n          \n                      \n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-hide-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets disabled\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/marvel-studios-infinity-saga-concert-eventim-apollo-21870784/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">On sale soon</a>              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"inline-block\" data-show-on-date=\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn--tickets \" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/marvel-studios-infinity-saga-concert-eventim-apollo-21870784/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"blank\">Buy tickets</a>              </div>\n                      \n            \n                      <a class=\"btn btn--on-navy ml-2\" href=\"https://www.eventim.co.uk/event/lounge-pass-upgrade-eventim-apollo-21440996/?affiliate=HAL\" target=\"_self\">Upgrade your night</a>                  </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 block md:hidden mt-sm\">\n                      <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"MARVEL IS 2027 LDN Eventim hero 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"variable-color mt-sm\">\n            <p>Join the Novello Orchestra for <strong><em>Marvel Studios’ Infinity Saga Concert Experience</em></strong>, a new Marvel Studios film concert that takes fans on an epic cinematic journey covering twenty-three films in one momentous concert experience. The performance, conducted by David Mahoney, is set for London’s Eventim Apollo on Thursday 11<sup>th</sup> February 2027 and follows on from a debut UK tour last year, which included two sell out performances at London’s Royal Festival Hall.<br /></p>\n<p>Embark on a thrilling and unprecedented live concert journey through the Infinity Saga - from the Tesseract’s concealment on Earth by the Asgardians, across time and space to Tony Stark’s ultimate sacrifice. Revisit the earliest days of Iron Man, Captain America, and Thor as they discover their place in the Marvel Cinematic Universe – each accompanied by their own unforgettable heroic music. Recapture the excitement as Earth’s mightiest heroes join forces for the first time and open the door to the next wave of Avengers. </p>\n<p>This unique Marvel Studios adventure connects events, themes and characters from the MCU and celebrates “The Avengers,” “Iron Man,” “Black Panther,” “Black Widow,” “Thor,” “Captain America,” “Captain Marvel,” “The Hulk,” “Ant Man” and many more. The Guardians of the Galaxy don’t miss this party either, dropping in to deliver a taste of their iconic mixtape.<br /></p>\n<p><strong><em>Marvel Studios’ Infinity Saga Concert Experience</em></strong> debuted in August 2024 at the world-famous Hollywood Bowl and was conducted by the Los Angeles Philharmonic Music &amp; Artistic Director Gustavo Dudamel. This concert event is a can’t-miss celebration for legions of Marvel Studios fans and lovers of cine-concerts across the globe.</p>\n<p>Presentation licensed by Disney Concerts in association with Marvel Studios. © All rights reserved.</p>\n<p><strong>AGE RESTRICTION: </strong>No Under 8s, 12 and under accompanied with an Adult.</p>\n          </div>\n              </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 hidden md:block\">\n                  <div class=\"event-hero__image\">\n            \n    \n      \n\n  \n        <picture class=\"  \" style=\"\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=1067&amp;height=1067&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=800&amp;height=800&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"(min-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                                                                  <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <source media=\"\" srcset=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\">\n                        <img src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eventim/images/MARVEL-IS_2027_LDN_Eventim-hero_1080x1080.png?width=768&amp;height=768&amp;focus_crop=1080,1080,0.5,0.5\"\n          alt=\"MARVEL IS 2027 LDN Eventim hero 1080x1080\"\n          style=\"\"\n          decoding=\"async\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          width=\"1066\"\n          height=\"1066\"\n                    >\n    </picture>\n  \n\n          </div>\n\n                      <p class=\"variable-color text-right event-hero__caption hidden\">Marvel Studios&#039; Infinity Saga Concert Experience - 11th February 2027 at Eventim Apollo</p>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n      \n\n      \n      <div class=\"showings\" id=\"information-section\">\n        <div class=\" bg-eventim-navy text-white\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2 class=\"py-10\">Showings</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"showings__table\">\n                                      <div class=\"showings__table-top grid md:grid-cols-4 relative\">\n                <div class=\"\">Date <span class=\"md:hidden\">&</span></div>\n                <div class=\"\">Showtime</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors \">Doors</div>\n              </div>\n                            <div class=\"showings__table-row grid md:grid-cols-4 relative \">\n                <div>February 11th 2027</div>\n                <div>Evening</div>\n                <div class=\"showing__doors\">18:30</div>\n                <div class=\"md:text-center\">\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n              \n                      </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n              <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"py-md\">\n  <h2 class=\"variable-color\">Get pre-sale access by signing up to our newsletter</h2>\n    <div class=\"event-signup-content__form-wrapper mt-md\">\n    <div id=\"prepform\" class=\"accord-form\"></div>\n    <script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={2C975A98-C100-0F41-E92D-5A0BB8CB9FBB}\"></script>\n  </div>\n  </div>  </div>      \n      \n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"newsletter-modal fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full outline-none z-50\" id=\"newsletterModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__click-break\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__inner bg-white modal-dialog relative w-auto\">\n\n\t\t\n    <div class=\"newsletter-modal__close\">\n      <button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"54\" height=\"54\" viewBox=\"0 0 54 54\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect x=\"12.7285\" y=\"39.5977\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-45 12.7285 39.5977)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n<rect x=\"39.5977\" y=\"41.0117\" width=\"38\" height=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(-135 39.5977 41.0117)\" fill=\"#202867\"/>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t</button>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"newsletter-modal__body newsletter-modal__body--modal-app\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe src=\"/newsletter-modal-content\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"logo-slider bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"logo-slider__wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"slider\">\n      <div class=\"slide-track ticker-left-to-right sm:flex sm:items-center sm:content-center bg-white\">\n                                  <div class=\"logo-slider__item slide\">\n              \n    \n      \n\n            <img class=\"\"\n  src=\"https://aeg-media-assets.b-cdn.net/eve